# Documentation

## Canonical sources

| Topic | Location |
|-------|----------|
| Domain + Changelog | `apps/docs/core/platform-guide.md` |
| Agent condensed domain | `.cursor/rules/platform-guide.mdc` |
| Getting started | `apps/docs/guides/getting-started.md` + root `README.md` |
| Schema details | `apps/docs/guides/data-schema.md` |
| ML details | `apps/docs/guides/ml-pipeline.md` |
| Fit scenarios / thresholds | `.cursor/rules/ml-evaluation.mdc` + `src/train/diagnostics.py` |
| Setup / how to start | `setup.md` (+ `package.json` scripts) |
| Contributor process | `CONTRIBUTING.md` |
| Agent entry | `CLAUDE.md` |
| Release notes | root `CHANGELOG.md` (high level); platform-guide for product behavior |

## Rules

1. Every **feat** that changes behavior updates `platform-guide.md` Changelog in the same change.
2. Condensed Cursor rule `platform-guide.mdc` stays aligned with the docs guide.
3. New folder/feature convention → update `feature-folder-structure.mdc`.
4. New schema column → `data-schema` rule + guide + `src/shared/schema.py`.
5. Numbered design work → `plans/00N-title.md` + status in `plans/README.md`.
6. Write in active voice; address “you”; keep examples runnable.
